  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 607.02 Annual Reporting for Transporting Used Oil",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 607.02 Annual Reporting for Transporting Used Oil. A registered transporter that transports used oil pursuant to Env-Hw 1407 shall meet the annual reporting requirements of Env-Hw 1407.08 for the used oil transportation activities.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #6385-B, eff 11-26-96; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 600) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12348, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14281, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
